  '{"suggested_moods":["experimental","minimal"],"shot_types":["Centred symmetrical frame of the facade","Handheld walk-through of the gallery","Profile silhouette against a large artwork","Macro details of material and lighting fixtures"],"palette":["#F3F0E9","#101010","#FF6535","#C9C4B8"],"light_window_note":"ยังไม่มีข้อมูลยืนยัน — ต้องสำรวจหน้างานหรือใช้ข้อมูลทิศทางแสงที่ตรวจสอบได้"}'::jsonb,
