  '{"suggested_moods":["ambient","cinematic"],"shot_types":["Wide landscape with a human figure for scale","Backlit silhouette at golden hour","Slow aerial reveal (only with a valid drone permit)","Texture insert: water, rock, mist"],"palette":["#1B241C","#5C6B4F","#B9C3A6","#F3F0E9"],"light_window_note":"ยังไม่มีข้อมูลยืนยัน — ต้องสำรวจหน้างานหรือใช้ข้อมูลทิศทางแสงที่ตรวจสอบได้"}'::jsonb,
