  '{"suggested_moods":["cinematic","nostalgic","ethereal"],"shot_types":["Symmetrical front elevation","Detail pass across carving and patina","Silhouette in a doorway or arch","Wide frame with sky negative space"],"palette":["#2B2118","#8A6A3F","#D9C7A3","#101010"],"light_window_note":"ยังไม่มีข้อมูลยืนยัน — ต้องสำรวจหน้างานหรือใช้ข้อมูลทิศทางแสงที่ตรวจสอบได้"}'::jsonb,
