  'Phu Sa Dok Bua (Thai: ภูสระดอกบัว) National Park is a national park that lies in the Amnat Charoen, Mukdahan, and Yasothon Provinces of Thailand. The park''s headquarters are located at Amphoe Don Tan, Mukdahan Province.',
